---
import CloseModalBtn from "./CloseModalBtn.astro";

const images = [
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/1.webp", width: 1286, height: 978 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/2.webp", width: 1537, height: 960 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/3.webp", width: 1537, height: 960 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/4.webp", width: 1537, height: 960 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/5.webp", width: 1537, height: 960 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/6.webp", width: 1537, height: 960 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/7.webp", width: 668, height: 1447 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/8.webp", width: 668, height: 1447 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/9.webp", width: 668, height: 1447 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/10.webp", width: 668, height: 1447 },
  { src: "./images/screenshots/sumitomo/11.webp", width: 668, height: 1447 },
];
---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>Sumitomo Chemical - Data Lake Dashboard</h2>

  <p>
    The Sumitomo Chemical Data Lake Dashboard is a sophisticated tool designed
    to provide real-time insights into the company's vast data repository. This
    project aimed to create an intuitive, interactive dashboard that empowers
    stakeholders with easy access to critical data.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Company: Globant | Sumitomo Chemical Co., Ltd. <br />
    Role: Web UI Developer <br />
    Period: March 2024 – December 2024
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Frontend Development:</strong> Built entirely with
      <strong>React</strong> to deliver a dynamic and responsive dashboard experience.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Data Integration:</strong> Integrated with the company's Data Lake
      to visualize and analyze large volumes of data in real time.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Team Collaboration:</strong> Worked in a cross-functional team consisting
      of two backend developers, one designer, one project manager, one product designer,
      and one QA specialist.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Development Process</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Requirement Analysis & Planning:</strong> Collaborated with the team
      and engaged in daily client meetings to understand the project requirements
      and prioritize new implementations.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Design & Prototyping:</strong> Worked alongside designers and product
      experts to translate client needs into a functional and aesthetically pleasing
      dashboard.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Implementation:</strong> Developed a robust frontend using React, ensuring
      the dashboard was responsive, interactive, and user-friendly.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Integration & Testing:</strong> Coordinated with backend developers
      to ensure seamless data integration and worked closely with QA to verify functionality
      and performance.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Continuous Communication:</strong> Held daily meetings with the client
      to report progress, discuss new requirements, and fine-tune the dashboard features.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">Key Skill: React, Figma.</p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    Please note that this is a private project, so I cannot share a direct link
    to access the dashboard outside of the company's website. However, I will be
    sharing some screenshots to showcase the work in detail.
  </p>

  <div class="project__gallery pswp-gallery" id="project__gallery">
    {
      images.map((image) => (
        <a
          href={image.src}
          class="image-wrapper"
          data-pswp-width={image.width}
          data-pswp-height={image.height}
          target="_blank"
        >
          <img src={image.src} loading="lazy" alt="Project screenshot" />
        </a>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class="mb-6">
    The Sumitomo Chemical Data Lake Dashboard stands as a testament to my
    ability to craft sophisticated, data-driven frontend solutions using React.
    This project not only highlights my technical expertise in building dynamic
    user interfaces but also underscores my commitment to effective
    collaboration and agile client communication in a cross-functional team
    environment.
  </p>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://www.sumitomo-chem.co.jp/english/"
    target="_blank">Company's website</a
  >

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
